Use a warm ivory background with subtle floral decorations in the corners.

At the top, include language controls:

- KG
- RU

Display the main couple image or romantic image supplied by the user.

Use a beautiful composition with generous empty space, elegant typography, and a small downward scroll indicator.

Display:

"Алмаз & Анел"

"16 · 11 · 2026"

Below the names, show a subtle animated downward arrow or chevron to encourage scrolling.

Keep the layout optimized for vertical smartphone screens.

6. PAGE 3 — WEDDING INVITATION MESSAGE

Create an elegant section matching the third reference screenshot.

