7. PAGE 4 — WEDDING CALENDAR

Build a functional wedding calendar matching the supplied reference screenshots.

Wedding date: November 16, 2026.

Display:

- Month: НОЯБРЬ
- Year: 2026
- Wedding day: 16
- Ceremony start time: 16:00

Create a real November 2026 calendar grid with seven weekday columns.

Use Kyrgyz weekday abbreviations:

- ДШ
- ШШ
- ШР
- БШ
- ЖМ
- ИШ
- ЖК

The calendar must correctly position November 16, 2026. Highlight day 16 using an elegant red heart outline and a subtle underline.

Add the heading:

"БАШТАЛЫШЫ"

Display:

"16:00"

Add a rounded button:

"КАЛЕНДАРГА КОШУУ"

The button must generate or download a valid .ics calendar event for November 16, 2026, at 16:00 Bishkek local time.

Use the Asia/Bishkek timezone, UTC+06:00.

The calendar event should include:

- Event title: "Үйлөнүү тою — Алмаз & Анел"
- Date: November 16, 2026
- Start time: 16:00
- Location: Anel Grand Hall, Бишкек, Курманжан Датка көчөсү, 267

Use a correct calendar date calculation rather than hardcoding an inaccurate weekday.

8. PAGE 5 — LIVE COUNTDOWN TIMER

Create a premium countdown card inspired by the supplied reference.

Heading:

"Тойго чейин:"

Display four elegant circular counters:

- КҮН
- СААТ
- МҮН
- СЕК

Count down to November 16, 2026, at 16:00 Asia/Bishkek time.

Requirements:

- Update every second.
- Calculate the remaining time accurately.
- Handle the moment when the countdown reaches zero.
- Never display negative time.
- Display a graceful completed-state message after the event begins.
- Use responsive circular counters with thin gold borders and subtle shadows.

The countdown must use the actual wedding date, not a hardcoded sample number.

9. PAGE 6 — WEDDING PROGRAM

Create a beautiful vertical wedding timeline closely matching the reference screenshots.

Section heading:

"Тойдун жүрүшү:"

