Use alternating card placement:

- First event: card on the right.
- Second event: card on the left.
- Third event: card on the right.
- Fourth event: card on the left.
- Fifth event: card on the right.

Each event must have:

- A circular icon with a white background.
- A thin gold border.
- A subtle shadow.
- A time displayed in bold italic typography.
- An uppercase description in elegant serif typography.

Events:

